Scope note

The copyright line above is the upstream one, from
https://github.com/ZhangYangyi03/autoforge (LICENSE, 1,090 bytes), because
`service/autoforge_svc/` is a copy of that project rather than a fork: the
same MIT terms and the same holder apply to the copied modules.

Files added or changed by this repository (`lib/`, `presets/`,
`service/autoforge_svc/service.py`, `service/autoforge_svc/tests/`, and the
edits listed under "有改动的模块" in README.md) are released under the same
MIT terms.

`service/autoforge_svc/vendor/tars/` carries its own provenance and licence;
see `service/autoforge_svc/vendor/PROVENANCE.txt`.
